OL,3,GNEWSATwo men seriously injured in
OL,4,Asingle-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been seriously injured in
OL,7,Fa single-vehicle crash, police have
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FSurrey Police said officers were called
OL,11,Fto the junction of Barrow Green Road
OL,12,Fand Chalkpit Lane in Oxted shortly
OL,13,Fafter 03:00 BST on Friday, following
OL,14,Freports of the crash involving a black
OL,15,FSeat Arona.
OL,17,FThe two men, aged in their 20s, were
OL,18,Ftaken to hospital and their next of kin
OL,19,Fhave been informed, said the force. The
OL,20,Froad was closed following the crash and
OL,21,Fhas since reopened.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
